# Hill Country's third start (data/tour.json starts, areas): `run level hills hayes_hill` puts you at Hayes
# and Pierce, a second box of the level's area, so bombing Hayes tucked shows no wrong-way hint
# however far it is from Dolores and Twin Peaks.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 run level hills hayes_hill
hold up 10..300
hold ollie 300..6950
run 7000
expect event levelStart{level=hills,seconds=120} within 0..2
expect skater.pos.x < -1073 at 5
expect skater.pos.x > -278 at end
expect no event levelWrongWay
expect no event bail
